# wallhack

> **wallhack** (plural **wallhacks**)
>
> *(video games)* A patch enabling a player to cheat by modifying the properties of walls, as by making them transparent or nonsolid.

A Layer 3 tunneling tool built for network pivoting in penetration testing scenarios. By establishing a full dual-stack TUN interface on the [entry node](/concepts), traffic is routed transparently (TCP, UDP, ICMP, over both IPv4 and IPv6) without the need for proxy chains or SOCKS configuration.

The QUIC transport carries the tunnel over UDP, so any open outbound UDP port can serve as the egress path.

Every [entry node](/concepts) includes a built-in [CLI](/cli) and [REST API](/rest-api) for live tunnel management. The entire tool is distributed as a single static binary with no dependencies.

